  * `dimensional_transmutation_scalar` — **the scalar dimensional transmutation**:
    vanishing per-step contraction + positive accumulated floor, PROVED for the model;
  * `fieldSpace_model_certificate` — from the convergent field-space scalar data alone,
    the cluster convergence AND the model contraction floor (no physical input);
  * `physContraction_is_singleStep`, `physFloor_of_physContraction`,
    `physFloor_of_convergence_and_physContraction` — the reduction: the REAL physical
