OPEN (UNINHABITED — the same irreducible core, field-space renormalized form):

  * `FieldSpacePhysicalContraction := SingleStepDefectReduction.SingleStepDefectBound` —
    the REAL physical single-step contraction `ρ_phys < 1` uniform in `a`.  The field-space
    scalar series CONVERGES at `w → 1` (proved) but is UNDERDETERMINED: it fixes the MODEL
    contraction, not the real one; the determination `realδ_k ≤ δ_model,k` is `singleStep`,
    the foundational Bałaban RG datum.

The field-space renormalized construction is the TENTH independent confirmation of the same
core `singleStep` — a genuine new uniform MODEL physical contraction floor plus the scalar
dimensional-transmutation signature, but NOT the real physical contraction.  It does NOT
close 4D Yang–Mills. -/

